    {
      "name": "sample-elevation-grid",
      "description": "Reads the terrain model over a rectangle on a regular grid — one call instead of one per point. Elevations come back row-major from the north-west corner (row 0 is the northern edge), in metres, `null` where the model has no data. Ask for derivatives to get slope in degrees and aspect as degrees clockwise from north pointing downhill, computed from each cell's neighbours.",
